// NOTE: all texture/material references in this file are correctly cased and point at real files
// (verified against every file on disk, no mismatches). Issue #5's "Cannot load texture/material"
// errors (lowercase "us_facepaint.rvmat", "us_facepaint_co.paa") do NOT originate from this file -
// they must be baked into US_Facepaint.p3d's own face material/texture assignments. Fix belongs there.
// NOTE: unlike BW_Facepaint/US_Facepaint, there is no equivalent SERBIAN_Facepaint.rvmat, and
// addons/items/data/tex only has SERBIAN_Facepaint_co.paa - no _nohq (normal) or _smdi (specular)
// textures exist for the Serbian variant. Its material setup looks incomplete compared to this one.
